<decision #track.expose_resource_dsl_module.composition apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 1 reversibility = "medium" } (
    <question ?q>怎样让下游 SkillCapsule 依赖已发布 Resource DSL Skill？</?q>
    <answer { } (
      <raw-answer ?raw>依赖闭包必须继续由 Halfcode 统一规划。</?raw>
      <decision-text ?text>发布 package-contained authoring module，让 Halfcode 在一个 application assembly 中解析 typed sibling dependency；不在 host 合并 bundled plans。</?text>
      <rationale ?why>dependency topology、collision 与 content validation 继续只有 Halfcode 一个 authority。</?why>
      <evidence ?evidence>0.2.2 已有 bundled plan 与 source-repository module，但 tarball 尚未携带 source root。</?evidence>
    )>
  )>
<decision #track.expose_resource_dsl_module.source_equivalence apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "medium" } (
    <question ?q>package source 与 bundled plan 怎样保持一致？</?q>
    <answer { } (
      <raw-answer ?raw>不能让 packaged module 和 bundled plan 从不同物料生成。</?raw>
      <decision-text ?text>构建时先复制 canonical ResourcePackage 到 package-contained root，再从该 copy 重新规划 bundled plan，并由 tarball consumer 比较 projection。</?text>
      <rationale ?why>发布包内 source module 和 bundled plan 来自同一份生成物料。</?why>
      <evidence ?evidence>当前 post-tsdown build 已独立生成 bundled plan，可在同一步增加 source copy。</?evidence>
    )>
  )>
<decision #track.expose_resource_dsl_module.release apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" } (
    <question ?q>发布版本怎样选择？</?q>
    <answer { } (
      <raw-answer ?raw>公共 API 只做 additive module export。</?raw>
      <decision-text ?text>保持 system Skill 1.0.0 不变，将 Halfcode package 从 0.2.2 升到最小补丁 0.2.3。</?text>
      <rationale ?why>用户已授权在完整门禁后直接发布末端最小版本。</?why>
      <evidence ?evidence>registry 已发布 0.2.2，新增功能不需要 minor 版本。</?evidence>
    )>
  )>
